:Namespace Result
    gtol←1E¯2                                     ⍝ heuristic gradient-norm cutoff

    Converged←{⍵.(tolc>cost)}                     ⍝ SUCESS
    MaxIterations←{⍵.(toli<iter)}                 ⍝ FAILED: max iterations reached
    DampingSaturated←{⍵.(dmax≤dnorm)}             ⍝ FAILED: couldn't find an acceptable step
    StalledByEscalation←{⍵.((tolr>rel)∧1<dnorm)}  ⍝ FAILED: false-stall
    StalledByPrecision←{⍺←gtol                    ⍝ FAILED: precision loss at low damping
        ⍵.((tolr≤rel)∨1<dnorm):0
        ⍺<0.5*⍨+/×⍨⍵.(grad×⍤1⊢pscale)
    }
    Stalled←{⍵.(tolr>rel)}                        ⍝ bare mechanical fact, no attempt to explain why
:EndNamespace